<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first day of four-day Supersport Series cricket matches on Friday.</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Western Province 269-2 (Jacques Kallis 90 not out, Desmond Haynes 83) v Natal.</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Free State 178 (Alan Badenhorst 4-39). Eastern Province 131-3 (Louis Koen 57, Kepler Wesserls 50 not out).</p>
<p>In Centurion: Northern Transvaal v Transvaal - no play, rain</p>
</text>
